                    <div class="text-group_4" justify-between>
                        <span class="text_13">徐州市2026年度考试录用公务员网报专题</span>
                        <span class="text_14">2025-11-02 11:34:39</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text_23">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                    </span>
                    <!-- 内容 -->
                    <div class="scroll-container" style="position: relative;left:0;height:40%; overflow: hidden;">
                        <div id="scrollContent" class="scroll-content">
                                <span id="download" class="paragraph_1">
                                    <p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋_GBK;font-size:29px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">徐州市</span><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">2026年度考试录用公务员网报专题</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋简体;font-size: 18px">&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋简体;font-size: 21px">***网报入口在本网页最下边***</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋简体;font-size:21px">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">报名前要认真阅读有关公告信息，详细了解招考政策、招录职位、报考条件、报名及考试办法等，并做好以下准备：了解网报流程及注意事项、制作好电子照片、申请开通银行卡的网上支付功能等。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px">1.</span><a href="http://www.xzdj.cn/Category_1226/Index.aspx"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">徐州党建网公务员考录专栏</span></span></a></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px">2.</span><a href="http://www.xzdj.cn/Item/24182.aspx"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">徐州市</span>2026<span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">年度考试录用公务员简章（含职位表）</span></span></a></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><a href="http://www.jszzb.gov.cn/col95/91153.html"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px">3.<span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">江苏省</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋_GBK;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">年度考试录用公务员报考指南</span></span></a></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><a href="http://hrss.xz.gov.cn/rsks"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:#FF0000;font-size:21px">4.<span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">报名网址：徐州人事考试网</span></span></a></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">一、时间安排</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（一）</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">时间</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">：</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">202</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年</span>11<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span>9∶00<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">11</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">0</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span>16∶00</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">；</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（二）</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">资格初审</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">时间</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">：</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">202</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年</span>11<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span>9∶00<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">11</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">12</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span>16∶00</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">；</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考者网上提交报名信息</span>48<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">小时后，可在报名网站查询资格初审结果</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">通过资格初审的，不得再报考其他职位。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:39px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（三）缴费时间</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">：</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">202</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年</span>11<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span>9∶00<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">11</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">13</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span>16∶00</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">；</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考者通过资格初审、照片审核后，在缴费截止时间前完成网上缴费，报名方为有效，逾期视为自动放弃报考资格，缴费状态以报名网站显示为准</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（四）重要提醒：</span>1.<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名必须使用有效期内的二代身份</span></span><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">证，报名与考试用的身份证必须一致；</span>2.202</span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span></span><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年</span>11<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span></span><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span>16:00<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">后报名系统将自动关闭，系统不再接受新报考人员的报名、已报考人员修改信息和</span></span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">初</span><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">审不通过人员改报其他职位；</span>3.</span><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名结束后，有效报名人数与招录人数之比小于开考比例的职位，由市公务员主管部门按照规定程序核减录用计划，直至取消该职位。报考被取消职位并完成缴费的人员，可在相关网站重新补报其他符合条件的职位，补报名时间为</span>2025<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">11</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">14</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">9∶00-16∶00</span></span><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">；</span>4.<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">考虑到报名后需要</span></span><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">初</span><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">审和缴费，请尽早报名并及时关注审核结果和缴费状态。</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">二、报名流程</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">通过网报入口进入</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">江苏省网上报名管理系统</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">在网页列表中选择</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">江苏省</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年度考试录用公务员</span>(<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">徐州市</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">)</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">网上报名</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">点击进入</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">进入登陆注册界面，所有报考</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">必须先点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">注册</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">进行注册。详细阅读</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">网上报名诚信协议</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">等内容后点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">同意</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">填写个人注册信息。注册成功后重新登陆会自动进入</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">查看报名进度</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">页面，在此页面可以查看报名流程及进度。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">第一步，选择部门职位</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考者在全省范围内只能选择一个职位报名，并在报考职位所在考区参加笔试</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">选择部门职位</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">进入部门职位选择界面</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">。根据需要选择报考部门和报考职位，点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">下一步</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">查看职位要求，确认无误后点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考此职位</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">，再次确定后完成部门职位报考。</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">一人只能报考一个职位，信息提交后，招录单位尚未</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">审核或审核不通过的报考</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">可改报其他职位，</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">审核通过的报考</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">将不能改报其他职位，请慎重选择。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">第二步，</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">填写基本信息</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">完成部门职位选择后会自动进入</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">填写基本信息</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">界面。</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">填写前请认真阅读填写要求与说明文字，按要求填写个人信息并对所填信息的正确性及准确性负责，完成后保存。</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考者提供虚假报考材料的，一经查实，即取消报考资格。对伪造、变造有关证件、材料、信息，骗取考试资格的，将按照有关规定严肃处理</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">第三步，上传照片</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">提交基本信息后进入</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">上传照片</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">界面。仔细阅读上传照片的要求，在本地电脑上按要求编辑好照片，点击示例照片下方的</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">“</span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">浏览</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">”</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">按钮，找到事先编辑好的照片，选定打开后，点击</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">“</span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">上传</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">”</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">按钮，如无问题系统会弹出</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">上传成功</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">提示对话框，点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">确定</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">即可。上传成功后，在</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">已上传照片</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">中可以查看上传照片是否合乎要求。</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">上传的照片一定要符合要求，</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">照片上</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">无姓名和身份证号</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">等个人信息</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">清晰无变形</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">能清楚辨认相貌，否则不能通过审核。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">第</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">四</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">步，选择考试地区</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">信息提交后进入</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">选择考试地区</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">界面。考生只能选择报考职位所在地作为笔试考区</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">第</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">五</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">步，查看审核结果</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名信息和电子照片提交成功后，招录单位将根据填写的报名信息进行报考条件资格初审；信息审核将在成功提交信息后</span>48<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">小时内进行。</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">资格审核通过后，</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">市人事考试中心将对电子照片进行审核。审核通过的不能修改任何信息。审核未通过的可点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">修改并重报</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">” </span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">修改个人信息、重新上传符合要求的照片或改报其他职位。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">第六步，</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">笔试</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">缴费</span> </span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考者通过资格初审、照片审核后，</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">笔试缴费</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">，选择支付方式，点击</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">支付</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">进入网上支付页面，提交成功后报名系统将告知缴费成功。完成缴费的方可视为报名成功</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">如果出现重复缴费的情况，我们会在笔试结束后将多交的费用</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">原路</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">退回。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">三、准考证打印</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">本网站仅提供报考徐州职位的</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">报考者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">打印准考证。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名确认成功的报考者请于</span>2025<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">12</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">9∶00</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">12</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">15∶00</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">期间，登录报名网站打印准考证。如遇问题，请与市人事考试中心联系解决</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">如准考证上的照片无法显示请更换浏览器或者电脑重新登录</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">如无法进入准考证打印页面请注意检查是否已通过资格初审并缴费成功</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">是否</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">登录</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">原报名网站。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">四、注意事项</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（一）报考</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">要认真、如实填写个人信息，在录入个人信息时，如遇姓名中有生僻字，输入法无法输出该汉字或系统不能正常显示该汉字的，可以先用同音或形似字代替录入，然后在报名期间向市人事考试中心申请信息更正。</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">信息更正</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">办理流程</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">：</span>1</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">.</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">持报考</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">身份证原件和复印件到徐州人力资源服务中心</span>A505<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">室办理；</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">.</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">办理时间：</span>11<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日至</span>11<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">0</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日（工作日</span>14:00<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">－</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">17</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">00</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日截至</span>15<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">00</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">）。除上述情</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">况外，报名信息一经审核通过，不予修改。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（二）</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">最低生活保障家庭及残疾人报考者参加笔试后</span>5<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">个工作日内可与市人事考试中心联系（</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">0516-80800325</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">），办理费用减免事宜</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（三）报考者须在规定时间内自行打印准考证。</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报考者应当携带准考证和在有效期内的二代身份证，按照准考证上确定的时间和地点参加笔试。报考者参加考试时持有的身份证必须与报名时所使用的身份证姓名、公民身份号码相一致。</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">准考证是</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">成绩查询、</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">面试资格复审的重要凭证，</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">请妥善保管</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">五、友情提醒</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（一）注册密码区分大小写，报考</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">在设置密码时，请设置为便于记忆并确保安全的密码，不要</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">泄露给他人。严禁请他人代报名或替他人报名</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（二）</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">报考者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">在全省范围内只能选择一个职位报考，填报信息时应谨慎准确，请勿进行所谓的</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">尝试</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">报名，如输入的报名信息符合所选职位报考条件并通过资格初审，将不得更改职位或修改信息，误报或录入错误后果自负。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（三）报考</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">上传的电子照片如不符合要求，可通过</span>PHOTOSHOP<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">等图像处理软件改变图像格式及大小。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（四）建议</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">不要等到最后一天报名，</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">以避开高峰期。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（五）网络报名采用的是线上缴费模式，请报考</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">务必在网上支付以后，及时查看缴费状态是否为缴费成功。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">（六）报名期间请密切关注报名网站，有关考试信息将通过网站公布。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">六、报名咨询</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">有关简章和各招录</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">机关</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">的招考人数、具体职位、考试类别、资格条件等信息可通过以下网站查询：徐州党建网公务员考录专栏（</span>http://www.xzdj.cn/Category_1226/Index.aspx<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">）、徐州人事考试网（</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">https://hrss.xz.gov.cn/rsks</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">）。有关报考政策规定、网络报名要求等事宜详见《江苏省</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年度考试录用公务员报考指南》。报考者对招录职位的专业、学历、学位、技能、证书等资格条件有疑问需要咨询时，可直接与招录</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">机关</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">联系。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;font-size: 21px"><br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always"/></span></strong><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋_GBK;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">徐州市</span><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋_GBK;font-size:21px">6</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋_GBK;font-size:21px">年度考试录用公务</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋_GBK;font-size:21px">员</span><span style=";font-family:方正小标宋_GBK;font-size:21px">招录单位咨询电话</span></p><table cellspacing="0" align="center"><tbody><tr style="height:45px" class="firstRow"><td width="46" valign="center" nowrap="" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">序号</span></p></td><td width="158" valign="center" nowrap="" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;line-height:40px"><span style="font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">地区名称</span></p></td><td width="209" valign="center" nowrap="" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); 